* 9 Nov 26 Windows port - from Linux Solo 15767b9 (SOLO 47, the owner: "the windows solo should get pdf").  Copy-Item through PowerShell replaces cp and chmod; the directory is a drive-letter path (any of the
*               spellings !VIEWLIST 'native' knows).  The message ids are Linux's plus 1005.
* 28 Oct 26 dm  S.87: CLOSESEQ and EQU are gone as statements: this program says CLOSE and EQUATE.
* 23 Oct 26 dm  New (S.75; the owner: "in the shared account directory should be the documentation PDF's").
